  "prefLabel": "Ed 606.02 Program Assessment System",
  "priorExpiration": "1990-05-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 606.02 Program Assessment System. A PEPP shall have a program assessment system that:\n\n(a) Continuously and systematically gathers data to monitor and improve the:\n\n(1) Curriculum;\n\n(2) Clinical experience;\n\n(3) Assessment of candidates; and\n\n(4) Overall quality of programs;\n\n(b) Demonstrates a process to make judgments based on the data collected;\n\n(c) Uses the process for continuous program improvement to ensure the quality of individual candidate preparation;\n\n(d) Includes data on program completers; and\n\n(e) Includes information and data gathered for federal and state reporting requirements as well as reports required for regional and national accreditation.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84, EXPIRED 5-16-90\n\nNew. #4851, eff 6-25-90; ss by #6048, eff 6-2-95; ss by #6366, eff 10-30-96; ss by #8194, eff 10-26-04; ss by #10295, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13744, eff 9-15-23",
